{"sha": "ae12eef03a69a4577f1bd6396137c2830264d31fbf9adb3dd9b2c426d1edd3f0", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g12:projectile-motion} 章 --- 自由落体与抛体运动}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:projectile-motion:1}", "$h = \\tfrac12 \\times 9.81 \\times 2.0^2 = \\qty{19.6}{m}$；", "$v = gt = \\qty{19.6}{m/s} \\approx \\qty{71}{km/h}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:projectile-motion:2}", "月球上没有空气：二者都只受重力，$m\\vect a = m\\vect g$ 给出", "对任意质量都有 $\\vect a = \\vect g$。在地球上，羽毛所受的阻力", "与其微小的重力相当：它以约 \\qty{1}{m/s} 的终端速率下落，", "而铁锤几乎不受空气影响。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:projectile-motion:3}", "$t = \\sqrt{2h/g} = 0.45$、$1.4$、\\qty{4.5}{s}；", "$v = gt = 4.4$、$14$、\\qty{44}{m/s}。时间随 $\\sqrt h$ 增长：", "高度增至 $\\times 100$ 时，时间只增至 $\\times 10$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:projectile-motion:4}", "$h = v_0^2/2g = \\qty{11.5}{m}$，出现在 $t = v_0/g = \\qty{1.53}{s}$ 时；", "在 \\qty{3.06}{s} 时回到原处，速率再次为 \\qty{15}{m/s}（对称性）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:projectile-motion:5}", "$t = \\sqrt{2 \\times 0.80/9.81} = \\qty{0.40}{s}$；", "$x = 2.5 \\times 0.40 = \\qty{1.0}{m}$。不对：", "下落时间只由竖直运动决定（独立性）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:projectile-motion:6}", "$(\\ang{15},\\ang{75})$ 与 $(\\ang{30},\\ang{60})$ 射程相同；", "\\ang{45} 射程最远。互余的一对中，角度较大者飞行时间更长：", "$t_f = 2v_0\\sin\\alpha/g$ 随 $\\alpha$ 增大而增大。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:projectile-motion:7}", "由 $4.905\\,t^2 + 5.0\\,t - 20 = 0$ 可得", "$t = (-5 + \\sqrt{25 + 392.4})/9.81 = \\qty{1.57}{s}$；", "$v = 5.0 + 9.81 \\times 1.57 = \\qty{20.4}{m/s}$。用能量法：", "$v = \\sqrt{5.0^2 + 2 \\times 9.81 \\times 20} = \\qty{20.4}{m/s}$ ——", "结果相同。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:projectile-motion:8}", "$t_f = 2 \\times 40 \\times \\sin\\ang{30}/9.81 = \\qty{4.1}{s}$；", "$h = (40\\sin\\ang{30})^2/(2 \\times 9.81) = \\qty{20.4}{m}$；", "$R = 40^2 \\sin\\ang{60}/9.81 = \\qty{1.4e2}{m}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:projectile-motion:9}", "$R = 10.5^2\\sin\\ang{40}/9.81 \\approx \\qty{7.2}{m}$。未计入的部分：", "质心起跳较高（人体有一定大小），落地时则较低、更靠前（双腿前伸），", "而且人并非质点——", "缺少的 \\qty{1.7}{m} 来自这一几何构型，而不是抛物线本身。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:projectile-motion:10}", "两球同时落地：二者 $v_y(0) = 0$，故下落时间相同，", "$t = \\sqrt{2 \\times 1.2/9.81} = \\qty{0.49}{s}$；被水平射出的球落在", "距离 $300 \\times 0.49 \\approx \\qty{1.5e2}{m}$ 处。该实验检验", "水平运动与竖直运动的独立性。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:projectile-motion:11}", "$\\sin\\bigl(2(\\ang{90}-\\alpha)\\bigr) = \\sin(\\ang{180}-2\\alpha) =", "\\sin(2\\alpha)$：$R$ 相同。此处 $\\sin(2\\alpha) = gR/v_0^2 =", "9.81 \\times 50/625 = 0.785$：$\\alpha = \\ang{25.9}$ 或 \\ang{64.1}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:projectile-motion:12}", "$R_{\\max} = v_0^2/g = \\qty{6.5}{m}$（取 \\ang{45}）；", "$h_{\\max} = v_0^2/2g = \\qty{3.3}{m}$（竖直向上）。", "$\\sin(2\\alpha) = 9.81 \\times 5.0/64 = 0.766$：$\\alpha = \\ang{25.0}$", "或 \\ang{65.0}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:projectile-motion:13}", "$y(15) = 15\\tan\\ang{35} - \\dfrac{9.81 \\times 15^2}", "{2 \\times 18^2 \\cos^2\\ang{35}} = 10.5 - 5.1 = \\qty{5.4}{m}$：", "小球越过高 \\qty{4.0}{m} 的篱笆，约高出 \\qty{1.4}{m}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:projectile-motion:14}", "(a) 阻力与重力平衡：$80 \\times 9.81 \\approx \\qty{7.8e2}{N}$。", "(b) $v(t)$ 的斜率越来越小，最终趋于", "\\qty{55}{m/s}。(c) 真空中：", "$\\sqrt{2 \\times 9.81 \\times 2000} \\approx \\qty{2.0e2}{m/s}$，", "是实际 \\qty{9}{m/s} 的二十倍——", "雨滴下落的几乎全程都以终端速率运动。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:projectile-motion:15}", "在 $t^* = D/(v_0\\cos\\alpha)$ 时，飞镖的高度为", "$v_0\\sin\\alpha\\, t^* - \\tfrac12 g t^{*2} = D\\tan\\alpha - \\tfrac12 g", "t^{*2} = H - \\tfrac12 g t^{*2}$，恰好等于下落猴子的", "$y = H - \\tfrac12 g t^{*2}$。二者都比无重力时的位置低 $\\tfrac12 gt^2$，", "对任意 $v_0$ 都会相遇。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:g12:projectile-motion:1}", "\\textbf{1.} 只受重力（忽略空气）；由牛顿第二定律：", "$m\\vect a = m\\vect g$，故 $\\vect a = (0,\\,-g)$。", "", "\\textbf{2.} $v_x = v_0\\cos\\alpha$，$v_y = v_0\\sin\\alpha - gt$。", "", "\\textbf{3.} $x = v_0\\cos\\alpha\\, t$，", "$y = v_0\\sin\\alpha\\, t - \\tfrac12 gt^2$。", ""]}